# HULK SMASH!: "Teamwork 4 ... Choose one. If this spell was cast using teamwork, choose both instead." Bot1 pays teamwork by tapping its
# Giant Cockroach (power 4, exactly the total needed) and so chooses both modes, each with its own targets. "Noncreature artifact"
# refuses Bot2's Memnite (an artifact creature) and takes its Mox Sapphire; "creature you control" takes Bot1's Centaur Courser (3/3)
# and refuses Bot2's Blackguard, and "creature an opponent controls" takes Bot2's Bane Alley Blackguard (1/3) and refuses Bot1's Courser. The Courser deals damage equal to
# its power, 3 (a lone Courser, power 3, can't pay teamwork 4: the refusal), to the other, which dies; the Courser itself takes none (one-sided, not a fight).

[Bot1 Deck]
Hulk Smash!
Giant Cockroach
Centaur Courser
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Bane Alley Blackguard
Memnite
Island x3
Island x20

